</span></div>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S4.T2.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:165.6pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.T2.fig2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.fig2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Neptune Results<span id="S4.T2.fig2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. We report accuracy on the evaluation set. Direct inference and <span id="S4.T2.fig2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#401AFF;--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">CAViAR</span> results use Gemini 1.5 Flash. Other results reported from original dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite>.</span></span></figcaption>
<div id="S4.T2.fig2.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:165.6pt;height:49.9pt;vertical-align:-23.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-99.1pt,29.9pt) scale(0.455070992511413,0.455070992511413) ;">
