<th id="S4.T2.fig2.5.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">MiniCPM-v <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">32</a>]</cite></th>
