<section id="as1" class="ltx_section ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">CAViAR: Critic-Augmented Video Agentic Reasoning Supplemental Material</h2>

<section id="as1_S1" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">1 </span>Module API</h2>

<div id="as1_S1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="as1_S1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The full module API can be seen in <a href="#as1_LST1" title="Listing 1 ‣ 1 Module API ‣ CAViAR: Critic-Augmented Video Agentic Reasoning Supplemental Material ‣ CAViAR: Critic-Augmented Video Agentic Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. The modules included vary by the strategy being sampled.</p>
</div>
<figure id="as1_LST1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="as1_LST1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="as1_lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="as1_lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">@dataclasses</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">.</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">dataclass</span>
</div>
