er" style="font-size:80%;">answer</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.39" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">choices</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.41" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">that</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.43" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">best</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.45" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">answers</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.47" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">the</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.49" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">‘question‘.</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">  </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.51" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">Clearly</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.53" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">state</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.54" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.55" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">your</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.56" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.57" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">chosen</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.58" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.59" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">answer</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.60" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="as1_lstnumberx88.61" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">choice.</span>
