<div id="as1_S4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="as1_S4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The critic is given <math id="as1_S4.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>4</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4</annotation></semantics></math> in-context examples per prompt. These examples are written by the authors with the aim of being in-distribution for the datasets shown.</p>
</div>
