="as1_lstnumberx299.8.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>she’s<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>going<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>to<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>gym,<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>eating<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>salmon,<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>or<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>going<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>to<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.51" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>park.<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Therefore,<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.53" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>I<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.54" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>will<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.55" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>eliminate<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.56" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>those<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.57" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>options.<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.58" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">  </span>Final<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.59" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Answer:<span id="as1_lstnumberx299.8.60" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>(3)"</span><span id="as1_lstnumberx299.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">)</span>
