<section id="as1_S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Additional Results</h2>

<section id="as1_S5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.1 </span>EgoSchema</h3>

<div id="as1_S5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="as1_S5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also report results on the EgoSchema dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#as1_bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite> for comparison with other approaches.</p>
</div>
<figure id="as1_S5.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="as1_S5.T1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="as1_S5.T1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">EgoSchema Results<span id="as1_S5.T1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. We report accuracy on the evaluation subset of <math id="as1_S5.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>500</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">500</annotation></semantics></math>. Direct inference results use Gemini 1.5 Flash. Other results reported from respective method papers. </span></span></figcaption>
